# Backend Project Context

This is the Laravel API for the canonical product catalog marketplace. It owns all business rules and is the only layer that talks to PostgreSQL/PostGIS, Redis, Meilisearch, object storage, AI, geocoding, and email.

## Responsibilities

- JSON API under `/api` for the Next.js frontend only (no public third-party API yet)
- Sanctum bearer auth with Public / Auth / Seller / Admin access levels
- Domain logic in services; vendor access via contracts + adapters
- Queues and scheduler for AI work and peer-review window expiry
- Stable error shape: `{ code, message, errors? }`; money as integer minor units + currency

## Stack anchors

PostgreSQL 16 + PostGIS, Redis + Horizon, Meilisearch (Scout), S3-compatible storage, AI and geocoding behind interfaces.

Follow `.cursor/rules/development-stages.mdc` for build order. Do not skip ahead of the current sprint.
